        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8003IW, White Porcelain Knobset with Porcelain Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Ice White Porcelain Knobset would look stunning in any colonial home installed on dark doors. It's the retro look that makes the style of the Porcelain White Knob with Matching Rose so uniquely bold. This knobset looks classic, but at the same time, it speaks of a practiced eye for design. This porcelain door knob will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick with backsets of either 2-3/4 inches or 2-3/8 inches. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The center ring in the rosette is available in several beautiful finishes so you can tie in your new door handles into the look of your finished home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Retro Porcelain White Knob with Matching Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ice White Porcelain Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Finish: White Porcelain</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Finish: White Porcelain</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Steam: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ice White Porcelain Knobset",
                "description": "The Ice White Porcelain Knobset would look stunning in any colonial home installed on dark doors. It's the retro look that makes the style of the Porcelain White Knob with Matching Rose so uniquely bold. This knobset looks classic, but at the same time, it speaks of a practiced eye for design. This porcelain door knob will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick with backsets of either 2-3/4 inches or 2-3/8 inches. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The center ring in the rosette is available in several beautiful finishes so you can tie in your new door handles into the look of your finished home.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Porcelain Ice White Knob with White Roses, Ice White Porcelain Knobsets, Emtek 8003IW, Emtek 8030IW, Emtek 8040IW, victorian knobs, traditional knobs, white Porcelain Knobset with White Porcelain Rosettes, retro knobs, 1920's knobs, EMT-8003IW, Ice White Porcelain Door Knobs, Retro Porcelain White Knob with Matching Roses, White Porcelain Knobset with Porcelain Rosettes, colonial knobs,"
